rconnected World:</strong> Find hidden paths, enter caves, discover new areas and create shortcuts, all in a physically coherent world with no loading screens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Combat:</strong> The game focuses on movement, rather than heavy combat. The world is filled with creatures, some aggressive some peaceful, and how you engage with them is up to you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind-Mapping: </strong>Guidance is heavily based on the memorization of the environment, it\u2019s components and the marks you place. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Secrets:</strong> Secrets are discovered through subtle hints and thinking outside the box.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple Controls:\u00a0</strong>The game emphasizes navigation over complex actions. It can be played with one hand using a keyboard, mouse, or either side of a gamepad.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-Night Events:</strong> Experience a day-night cycle with events that change based on the time of day. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal UI:</strong> Enjoy a clean, immersive experience with minimal UI and no distracting indicators.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Co-op:</strong> Play with another friend in local cooperative mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/dd177a03be7438977b02de71e0e3df69.poster.avif?t=1771878447\" width=780 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/dd177a03be7438977b02de71e0e3df69.webm?t=1771878447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/dd177a03be7438977b02de71e0e3df69.mp4?t=1771878447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/extras/0c7a3b621237b05f776bab7e22adcd13.avif?t=1771878447\" width=1560 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! We are <strong>Ricotoni Games</strong>! A <strong>two-person team</strong> that make games out of their <strong>love</strong> for them. We are trying our best to make games that <strong>WE</strong> would love to play! So those games might <strong>not appeal to everyone</strong>. What we really want is to <strong>create worlds</strong> that <strong>make us feel</strong> the <strong>same feelings</strong> we used to feel when we played games <strong>as kids</strong>.<br><br><strong>Music</strong> by <strong>Christos Giannopoulos</strong></p>","developers":["Ricotoni Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156020/707b3489ae40bd7d8760e4ce180fec5e3424c208/header.jpg?t=1771878447","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3156020/232107835/abd2b7c25b937dff4ab4c342bb499501382bacee/1770601320/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770601896","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3156020/232107835/abd2b7c25b937dff4ab4c342bb499501382bacee/1770601320/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770601896","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3156020/232107835/abd2b7c25b937dff4ab4c342bb499501382bacee/1770601320/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1770601896","id":257282523,"name":"Short Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257282523/a4d1dd975